#: aedc1397602746688109bb620d8acd63
msgid "TorchScript 用户指南"
msgstr "TorchScript User Guide"

#: 349828dd05924307bdd59cc3dbb12305
msgid "本文档仅适用于 HamGNN v2.0 版本。TorchScript 工具包目前不支持 v1.0 版本。"
msgstr "This document is only applicable to HamGNN v2.0. The TorchScript toolkit does not currently support v1.0."

#: 9597201547bc4c76bb66b5790d62784f
msgid "概述"
msgstr "Overview"

#: a7874eb1b560485195555760c90ea881
msgid ""
"HamGNN TorchScript 工具包为 HamGNN v2.0 模型提供完整的 TorchScript 编译和部署支持。通过将训练好的 "
"PyTorch Lightning checkpoint 转换为优化的 TorchScript 格式，可以实现更高效的模型推理和生产部署。"
msgstr "The HamGNN TorchScript toolkit provides full TorchScript compilation and deployment support for HamGNN v2.0 models. By converting trained PyTorch Lightning checkpoints into an optimized TorchScript format, more efficient model inference and production deployment can be achieved."

#: 3e3747e5e9d248af8a350a2538dd374f
msgid "主要功能"
msgstr "Main Features"

#: 246551cea61c4bda815d44a0b48a5417
msgid "**模型编译**: 将 HamGNN checkpoint (.ckpt) 转换为 TorchScript (.hamgnn.pt) 格式"
msgstr "**Model Compilation**: Convert HamGNN checkpoints (.ckpt) to TorchScript (.hamgnn.pt) format"

#: 17be01ac03d24f0d913766d2149e47ff
msgid "**一致性验证**: 确保编译前后模型输出的数值一致性"
msgstr "**Consistency Verification**: Ensure numerical consistency of model outputs before and after compilation"

#: 989d8f8f7636471486ee1d94c6c64d21
msgid "**性能测试**: 比较编译前后的推理速度"
msgstr "**Performance Testing**: Compare inference speeds before and after compilation"

#: 65175b45b5d5479d9be4da0105b4a485
msgid "**部署优化**: 生成可移植的模型文件用于生产环境"
msgstr "**Deployment Optimization**: Generate portable model files for production environments"

#: 9135d98c559c44779fd647aa5f55a144
msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Quick Start"

#: 222f26e627bc48f181e97fe121867dbe
msgid "1. 编译模型"
msgstr "1. Compile the Model"

#: d773187e391847a996c7ba250e8c7143
msgid "使用 ``hamgnn-compile`` 命令行工具将训练好的模型转换为 TorchScript 格式："
msgstr "Use the ``hamgnn-compile`` command-line tool to convert a trained model to TorchScript format:"

#: 100f4dfe8f4140d2bfc8ab2ade88ba6f
msgid "参数说明："
msgstr "Parameter Descriptions:"

#: 86a3cf8fd8ad4cadb264a1b00a761582
msgid "``--config``: 训练时使用的配置文件路径"
msgstr "``--config``: Path to the configuration file used during training"

#: d58a2ee09dfc431097be6c032a137c6a
msgid "``--checkpoint``: 训练好的 PyTorch Lightning checkpoint 文件"
msgstr "``--checkpoint``: Trained PyTorch Lightning checkpoint file"

#: eac47713e3134276b5f270bd3e6cc766
msgid "``--output``: 输出的 TorchScript 模型路径（建议使用 .hamgnn.pt 扩展名）"
msgstr "``--output``: Output path for the TorchScript model (``.hamgnn.pt`` extension is recommended)"

#: 6cd8cca4d9ff4265848dab4e6236da38
msgid "``--device``: 编译目标设备（cuda 或 cpu）"
msgstr "``--device``: Target device for compilation (cuda or cpu)"

#: 470a63e1ea8c450bbdd78be8120e48c9
msgid "2. 使用编译模型"
msgstr "2. Use the Compiled Model"

#: d6146ce396504ca78cf6abe51bd68fb8
msgid "在 Python 代码中加载和使用编译后的模型："
msgstr "Load and use the compiled model in your Python code:"

#: 1d5ea85c5a3b4fa08292830dec04b437
msgid "性能测试"
msgstr "Performance Testing"

#: 401006a826cf4740923b484c3ad476b9
msgid "使用 ``performance_test.py`` 进行全面的性能评估："
msgstr "Use ``performance_test.py`` for a comprehensive performance evaluation:"

#: ff83b2c02c344d3e9f6398dd621889e4
msgid "该脚本会自动进行："
msgstr "This script will automatically perform:"

#: 6d52ca8028bc41429cc869bdca4fcde0
msgid "TorchScript 模型与原始模型的性能对比"
msgstr "Performance comparison between the TorchScript model and the original model"

#: dbac0bcec12246cab934ace75ff913be
msgid "多种 batch_size 下的性能分析"
msgstr "Performance analysis under various batch sizes"

#: dc6bb2d79e9049edb375aa1b11e7170d
msgid "详细的性能统计和建议"
msgstr "Detailed performance statistics and recommendations"

#: a774f6c14e1345e9a474c2ac477a0726
msgid ""
"**注意**: 脚本中的 ``torch.compile`` 测试目前会失败，因为我们尚未完成 torch.fx "
"改造。这是技术路线图第二阶段的内容。"
msgstr "**Note**: The ``torch.compile`` test in the script will currently fail because we have not yet completed the torch.fx refactoring. This is part of the second phase of our technical roadmap."

#: c6b2ed254a2042d6b850adbdccd6fce6
msgid "注意事项：使用前需要修改脚本中的文件路径，将示例路径替换为你的实际文件路径。"
msgstr "Note: Before use, you need to modify the file paths in the script, replacing the example paths with your actual file paths."

#: 809333304bf3454390511c266bb4014d
msgid "部署最佳实践"
msgstr "Deployment Best Practices"

#: c79b3871b5074c659e2ce1493e792c87
msgid "1. 模型文件管理"
msgstr "1. Model File Management"

#: 765f6ee21b5647c69388d42c31a69fd9
msgid "**命名规范**: 使用 ``.hamgnn.pt`` 扩展名区分 TorchScript 模型"
msgstr "**Naming Convention**: Use the ``.hamgnn.pt`` extension to distinguish TorchScript models"

#: bf60b4745adf41e3ae2d0b544c74c22e
msgid "**元数据保存**: 编译过程会自动生成 ``.metadata.json`` 文件，包含配置和环境信息"
msgstr "**Metadata Saving**: The compilation process automatically generates a ``.metadata.json`` file containing configuration and environment information"

#: 3ef9616454824d489d65a35f321b4d71
msgid "**版本控制**: 建议将配置文件纳入版本控制，模型文件使用 Git LFS 管理"
msgstr "**Version Control**: It is recommended to include configuration files in version control and manage model files using Git LFS"

#: 1694bf124b174516ab871bc9c2907c3d
msgid "2. 性能优化建议"
msgstr "2. Performance Optimization Recommendations"

#: 532f4fe9187944a5a20a4281ce08f9db
msgid "**批处理大小**: 根据硬件配置选择合适的 batch_size，通常较大的批次有更好的性能"
msgstr "**Batch Size**: Choose an appropriate batch_size based on your hardware configuration; larger batches generally yield better performance"

#: 98c12561fe9c42d19e646001ded6fa93
msgid "**设备选择**: GPU 加速效果通常比 CPU 更明显"
msgstr "**Device Selection**: GPU acceleration is typically more significant than CPU"

#: e3b49bbe561d48f1854725b65372f422
msgid "**预热运行**: 首次推理可能较慢，建议进行预热运行排除 JIT 编译开销"
msgstr "**Warm-up Run**: The first inference may be slow; a warm-up run is recommended to exclude JIT compilation overhead"

#: adf3e7f72c024dc0bece29a864ebfdde
msgid "**内存管理**: 大规模推理时注意 GPU 内存使用情况"
msgstr "**Memory Management**: Pay attention to GPU memory usage during large-scale inference"

#: 73d4507b61464d4b9cc9e29cefb00dea
msgid "**重要提示**: 部署环境需要与编译环境的 CUDA、e3nn、NumPy 版本保持一致。"
msgstr "**Important Note**: The deployment environment must be consistent with the CUDA, e3nn, and NumPy versions of the compilation environment."

