msgstr "**Main Model File** (``.hamgnn.pt``): An executable model in TorchScript format"

#: a4f58453faa8489d9ca266f8afd63dbf
msgid "**元数据文件** (``.metadata.json``): 包含配置、编译信息和环境详情"
msgstr "**Metadata File** (``.metadata.json``): Contains configuration, compilation information, and environment details"

#: c37a4f0ec1ba46dc9c300d19d2901154
msgid "**输入格式**: 标准化的字典格式，包含所有必需的图数据字段"
msgstr "**Input Format**: A standardized dictionary format containing all required graph data fields"

#: 4a20255f7a0f40f897c5ea7e4d7d819b
msgid "**输出格式**: 包含哈密顿量等预测结果的字典"
msgstr "**Output Format**: A dictionary containing prediction results such as the Hamiltonian"

